  "text": "设平面区域 $D = \\{(x,y) : y > x^2\\}$，函数 $f(x,y) = y - x - \\log(y - x^2)$。\n\n(1-a) 求偏导数 $f_x(x,y), f_y(x,y)$。\n\n(1-b) 在 $D$ 上求 $f(x,y)$ 的极值，并确定是极大值还是极小值。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "偏导数计算",
    "驻点求解",
    "二阶偏导数",
    "Hessian矩阵",
    "极值判定准则"
  ],
  "question_type": "多元函数极值",
  "method": [
    "偏导数法",
    "二阶充要条件判定"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "计算一阶偏导数",
    "令偏导数为零求驻点",
    "计算二阶偏导数",
    "构造Hessian矩阵并判定极值"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "multivariate_extremum",
    "template": "求 $f(x,y) = y - x - \\log(y - x^2)$ 在 $D = \\{(x,y) : y > x^2\\}$ 上的极值",
    "variable_count": 2
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(1-a) 偏导数",
      "steps": [
        "$f_x(x,y) = -1 + \\frac{2x}{y - x^2}$",
        "$f_y(x,y) = 1 - \\frac{1}{y - x^2}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(1-b) 极值",
      "steps": [
        "令 $f_x = 0$：$\\frac{2x}{y - x^2} = 1 \\Rightarrow y - x^2 = 2x \\Rightarrow y = x^2 + 2x$",
        "令 $f_y = 0$：$\\frac{1}{y - x^2} = 1 \\Rightarrow y - x^2 = 1 \\Rightarrow y = x^2 + 1$",
        "联立两式：$x^2 + 2x = x^2 + 1 \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{1}{2}$，$y = \\frac{1}{4} + 1 = \\frac{5}{4}$",
        "驻点为 $\\left(\\frac{1}{2}, \\frac{5}{4}\\right)$，此时 $y - x^2 = 1$",
        "$f_{xx} = \\frac{2(y-x^2) + 4x^2}{(y-x^2)^2} = \\frac{2y + 2x^2}{(y-x^2)^2}$，在驻点处 $f_{xx} = 2 \\cdot \\frac{5}{4} + 2 \\cdot \\frac{1}{4} = 3$",
        "$f_{yy} = \\frac{1}{(y-x^2)^2} = 1$",
        "$f_{xy} = -\\frac{2x}{(y-x^2)^2} = -1$",
        "$H = \\begin{pmatrix} 3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 \\end{pmatrix}$，$\\det(H) = 3 - 1 = 2 > 0$，$f_{xx} = 3 > 0$",
        "点 $\\left(\\frac{1}{2}, \\frac{5}{4}\\right)$ 是极小值点，极小值为 $f\\left(\\frac{1}{2}, \\frac{5}{4}\\right) = \\frac{5}{4} - \\frac{1}{2} - \\ln 1 = \\frac{3}{4}$"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
