      "math_structure": {
        "type": "quadratic_extremum",
        "template": "求 $f(x,y) = x^2 + 2y^2 - 2xy$ 的极值",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "极值",
          "steps": [
            "$f_x = 2x - 2y = 0$，$f_y = 4y - 2x = 0$",
            "从第一式得 $x = y$，代入第二式得 $4y - 2y = 0$，即 $y = 0$",
            "驻点为 $(0, 0)$",
            "$f_{xx} = 2$，$f_{yy} = 4$，$f_{xy} = -2$",
            "$\\det(H) = 8 - 4 = 4 > 0$，$f_{xx} = 2 > 0$",
            "$(0, 0)$ 是极小值点，极小值为 $0$"
          ]
        }
