        "template": "求 $f(x,y) = x^3 + y^3 - 3xy$ 的极值",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "极值",
          "steps": [
            "$f_x = 3x^2 - 3y = 0$，$f_y = 3y^2 - 3x = 0$",
            "由第一式得 $y = x^2$，代入第二式得 $x^4 - x = 0$，即 $x(x-1)(x^2+x+1) = 0$",
            "在实数范围内，$x = 0$ 或 $x = 1$，对应驻点 $(0, 0)$ 和 $(1, 1)$",
            "在 $(0, 0)$：$f_{xx} = 0$，$f_{yy} = 0$，$f_{xy} = -3$，$\\det(H) = -9 < 0$，鞍点",
            "在 $(1, 1)$：$f_{xx} = 6$，$f_{yy} = 6$，$f_{xy} = -3$，$\\det(H) = 27 > 0$，$f_{xx} > 0$",
            "$(1, 1)$ 是极小值点，极小值为 $1 + 1 - 3 = -1$"
          ]
        }
